        ### Docker All impotent command and concept ###
  * Docker is a containerization method in which we can create multiple container and 
    inatll all prequirtes or dependencies for a individual application 
    in a single container and handle them easily in production
   
  * Go language is used for build docker 
  *  Docker is using Namespace Technologies
     * in porgraming a namespace is a conatiner that groups releted identifiers ( such as
       variable ,function, class, interface or modules ) under a unique name . its mian 
       purpose is to avoid name conflicts and improve code organization .
      
  
  * install docker 
    apt update -y
    apt install docker.io -y 
  
  * check version 
    docker --version
    systemctl start docker 
    systemctl enable docker 
    
  * dokcer info -> show the full details of over docker 
  * Docker container build by any image 
    so you can pull from docker hub or u can crete also
      * pull image 
         docker pull ubuntu:24.04
      * docker container run ubuntu -> run container in background and exited
      * docker container ps 
      * docker container ps -a
      * docker container start <container_id>
      * docker container stop <container_id>
      * docker container remove <container_id>
      * docker container run -d ubuntu sleep 30

      * docker container run -it ubuntu /bin/bash -> run container in 
         interactive mode and have bash shell 
      * docker conatiner run -itd ubuntu /bin/bash -> -d for detach mode 
      

